# Services no sounds, on the configsettings page of the instr selector.
# A .ui entry is not run as a program: Nebulae itself handles it (ui.py,
# mode = the name after the number, here "services_quiet").
# Speed click on it: on/off, and back to the instrument. On: the Pi's own
# LEDs off, USB off while the stick is not in use, the system log in RAM,
# network time sync, netctl-auto and the scheduled jobs stopped
# (Code/scripts/quiet.sh services). Saved (configsettings.py).
# Slot LED bright = on (nebulae-status).
